  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-48\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 48</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <section class=\"paragraph\" id=\"para-1\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 1.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p>L'article 44, alinéa premier, et l'article 46,</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <p>sont applicables aux membres du personnel administratif de la <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"1\" data-dossier-number=\"2010-02-21/01\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"34\">Cour constitutionnelle</span>.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"paragraph\" id=\"para-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 2.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p>Des dérogations peuvent leur être accordées par la Cour dans les cas où les dispositions applicables aux agents de l'Etat permettent à ceux-ci ou à leur conjoint l'exercice de certaines occupations complémentaires.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</article>",
